  "statements": [
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "Hello!\nWe're Barlean's and we make premium foods and nutritional supplements here in the Pacific Northwest. Our family business has grown a lot in 25+ years, but we still do things our way.\nCreate seriously delicious ways for people to get essential nutrients\nSource top quality ingredients to deliver maximum benefits\nShare our profits to help people locally and around the world\nWe're glad you're giving us a try & feel pretty good that you'll try us again!"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "3x better absorption\nOur special emulsified formula is absorbed better than traditional flax oil or softgels, so you get more of the Omega-3s your body needs."
